      743         input buf_qnty-group.qgr-id     ,
      744         input buf_qnty-group.name ,
      745         input-output v-rec-id ) .
      746     OPEN QUERY BROWSE-2cli FOR EACH buf_qnty-in-qnty-group OF buf_qnty-group      WHERE ( r-status = 2 OR buf_qnty-in-qnty-group.stts =  r-status )       NO-LOCK INDEXED-REPOSITION.
      747     reposition BROWSE-2cli to recid v-rec-id no-error .
      748   END.
      749   ON CHOOSE OF B-chg IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
